06-10 19:17<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FzNWKvVndHDMshmg_WyUvdQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/zNWKvVndHDMshmg_WyUvdQ</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息108.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e8/p2qk6c60ntwhlb6j6qahaua714dbler.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF108.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e8/p2qk6c60ntwhlb6j6qahaua714dbler.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" /><br /><br />\n<p><font color=\"#D2691E\">----------------------------------------&#160;<img alt=\"官方消息109.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/4due6dh292oc2yec578vkoocx7heuch.gif/40px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF109.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/4due6dh292oc2yec578vkoocx7heuch.gif/60px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF109.gif 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/4due6dh292oc2yec578vkoocx7heuch.gif/80px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF109.gif 2x\" data-file-width=\"500\" data-file-height=\"348\" />&#160;----------------------------------------</font>\n</p>\n</center><br />\n<p><font style=\"color:#A0522D\">团长们好呀！这里是铃兰之剑前线情报员小场记ヾ(๑╹◡╹)ﾉ\"\n<br /><br />\n广州的高温不敌团长们的热情，早上刚开馆就有非常多的团长来排队参与活动啦！</font>\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息115.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c1/mkbz8m6n6m07ir57o1avpt87gt0cq4g.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF115.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c1/mkbz8m6n6m07ir57o1avpt87gt0cq4g.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF115.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c1/mkbz8m6n6m07ir57o1avpt87gt0cq4g.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"720\" />\n<font style=\"color:#A0522D\">✦</font></center>\n<p><font style=\"color:#A0522D\">下午的时候小场记还捕捉到了UP主@丸子和@碳酸冰红茶  ！</font>\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息116.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/71/3v2tqota7ctlsv4uosbfq104fxgcud3.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF116.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/71/3v2tqota7ctlsv4uosbfq104fxgcud3.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF116.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/71/3v2tqota7ctlsv4uosbfq104fxgcud3.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"720\" /><br /><br />\n<p><img alt=\"官方消息117.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/be/g48yd4zkcnbs5r016k4uijxqugpsn11.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF117.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/be/g48yd4zkcnbs5r016k4uijxqugpsn11.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF117.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/be/g48yd4zkcnbs5r016k4uijxqugpsn11.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"720\" />\n</p>\n<font style=\"color:#A0522D\">✦</font></center>\n<p><font style=\"color:#A0522D\">还有《铃兰之剑》中文配音导演@张琦也来到现场参与挑战活动！</font>\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息118.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/q65u07lqq9w6tafhjaun9tk47rchnhb.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF118.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/q65u07lqq9w6tafhjaun9tk47rchnhb.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF118.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/78/q65u07lqq9w6tafhjaun9tk47rchnhb.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"720\" /></center>\n<p><br />\n<font style=\"color:#A0522D\">感谢团长们的支持！小场记带着福利周边在现场等待团长前来挑战哦！\n<br /><br />\n▼展台地点：<br />\n广州保利世贸博览馆3层6号馆A17展位\n<br /><br />\n▼参展时间：<br />\n2023年6月10日-6月11日9:00-17:00</font>\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><font color=\"#D2691E\">----------------------------------------&#160;<img alt=\"官方消息109.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/4due6dh292oc2yec578vkoocx7heuch.gif/40px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF109.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/4due6dh292oc2yec578vkoocx7heuch.gif/60px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF109.gif 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/4due6dh292oc2yec578vkoocx7heuch.gif/80px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF109.gif 2x\" data-file-width=\"500\" data-file-height=\"348\" />&#160;----------------------------------------</font><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息119.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a0/1b28wmtz3cmw89zsg8lnjl8ckebh71h.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF119.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a0/1b28wmtz3cmw89zsg8lnjl8ckebh71h.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF119.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a0/1b28wmtz3cmw89zsg8lnjl8ckebh71h.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"720\" /><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息120.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ec/mupftkyiga3rlp32dcqpsnh204oapru.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF120.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ec/mupftkyiga3rlp32dcqpsnh204oapru.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6